SRR1286230	PRJNA244322	SRP041083	SAMN02725399	SRX514996	Mus musculus	oocyte_RNA-Seq	oocyte_RNA-Seq	Illumina HiSeq 2000 sequencing: GSM1366944: oocyte_RNA-Seq Mus musculus RNA-Seq	RNA-Seq	TRANSCRIPTOMIC	cDNA	PAIRED	ILLUMINA	Illumina HiSeq 2000	Metaphase II oocytes were collect by removing all somatic contaminants. Sample for RNA isolation was collected in Buffer RLT (RNeasy Micro Kit from QIAGEN). The RNA-seq libraries were constructed as described (Tang et al., 2010). Briefly, reverse transcription was carried out at the first step. Then, free primers were removed by exonmulease I and a polyA tail was added to the 3' end of the first-strand cDNAs by terminal deoxynucleotidyl transferase. The cDNAs were amplified by PCR and subjected to construct a sequencing library sequenced by Illumina HiSeq 2000.	16057536	3243622272	ftp.sra.ebi.ac.uk/vol1/fastq/SRR128/000/SRR1286230/SRR1286230_1.fastq.gz;ftp.sra.ebi.ac.uk/vol1/fastq/SRR128/000/SRR1286230/SRR1286230_2.fastq.gz	ad364be4ae2141579208e3e392927245;404311152f38c362d3ba6e7cf3404507	1296108963;1326064288
